{"id":"n85945-1-14","stage":3,"title":"항의 · 抗议","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85945-1-14-1","ko":"손님, 무슨 일로 저희 종업원에게 항의를 하십니까?","zh":"您好，您为什么向我们的员工投诉？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"손님,","meaning":"客人，顾客","explanation":"손님：客人，顾客","readings":[{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71279","senseId":"2","lemma":"손님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"3","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일로","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"2","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저희","meaning":"我们","explanation":"저희：我们","readings":[{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71231","senseId":"2","lemma":"저희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"종업원에게","meaning":"员工","explanation":"종업원：员工；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"종업원","audio":"/audio/de0065d4ed04b417c301.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91757","senseId":"1","lemma":"종업원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"항의를","meaning":"抗议","explanation":"항의：抗议；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"항의","audio":"/audio/54ebd4ff61cdef0f3c4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85945","senseId":"1","lemma":"항의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하십니까?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3324c7e0bb86f28d","term":"손님","zh":"客人，顾客","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3","entryId":"71279","definition":"(尊称)来旅馆或餐厅等店铺的人。","pronunciation":["손님"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于强调预料之外的、不合理的事情。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带着某种计划和意图想要实现的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"75d5f0d25c8827a5","term":"저희","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3","entryId":"71231","definition":"说话人亲切地指代与自己有关的一些对象。一般对比自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["저히"]},{"id":"de0065d4ed04b417","term":"종업원","zh":"员工","audio":"/audio/de0065d4ed04b417c301.mp3","entryId":"91757","definition":"在职场等地从事某种业务的人。","pronunciation":["종어붠"]},{"id":"54ebd4ff61cdef0f","term":"항의","zh":"抗议","audio":"/audio/54ebd4ff61cdef0f3c4f.mp3","entryId":"85945","definition":"某事不正确或对其不满意而表示反对。","pronunciation":["항ː의","항ː이"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2df925fcc6a356ee81a8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n85945-1-14-2","ko":"여기 사장이에요? 음식에서 벌레가 나왔다고요.","zh":"你是这里的老板吗？我说饭菜里有虫子！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사장이에요?","meaning":"老板，总经理","explanation":"사장：老板，总经理；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"사장","audio":"/audio/ede38c8825edb7fbd7e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61274","senseId":"1","lemma":"사장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"음식에서","meaning":"饮食，饭菜","explanation":"음식：饮食，饭菜；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"1","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"벌레가","meaning":"虫子","explanation":"벌레：虫子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"벌레","audio":"/audio/ee023753239e5ca14bd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59098","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌레","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나왔다고요.","meaning":"出，长出","explanation":"나오다：出，长出；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다고요：重复、强调或确认所说的内容；带 요 时为礼貌表达。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"2","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"ede38c8825edb7fb","term":"사장","zh":"老板，总经理","audio":"/audio/ede38c8825edb7fbd7e4.mp3","entryId":"61274","definition":"代表公司对公司事务负责的人。","pronunciation":["사장"]},{"id":"2e144916046c2a6f","term":"음식","zh":"饮食，饭菜","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3","entryId":"71114","definition":"饭、汤等人们每顿食用的东西。","pronunciation":["음ː식"]},{"id":"ee023753239e5ca1","term":"벌레","zh":"虫子","audio":"/audio/ee023753239e5ca14bd3.mp3","entryId":"59098","definition":"昆虫或寄生虫等身体结构简单的动物。","pronunciation":["벌레"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出，长出","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"从里面冒到外面。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/41da1584906ec1bfd2d9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.097,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=85945","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":96,"sequenceScore":2.5737,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你是这里的老板吗？我说饭菜里有虫子！","您好，您为什么向我们的员工投诉？","承奎运动那么好，等长大了当运动员该多好啊。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["您好，您为什么向我们的员工投诉？","承奎运动那么好，等长大了当运动员该多好啊。","你是这里的老板吗？我说饭菜里有虫子！"],"answer":2}]}
